# T on an Overdue entry makes it due today, so it leaves Overdue and still shows in Today.
file <<END
- Pay bill @due({today-5})
- Call bank @due({today-1})
END
keys gO
see ▌ - Pay bill
keys T
hide Pay bill
see ▌ - Call bank
keys gt
see - Pay bill
quit
saved <<END
- Pay bill @due({today})
- Call bank @due({today-1})
END
